; Copy this file to `.npmrc` in the repository root and paste in your token:
;
;   cp .npmrc.example .npmrc
;
; `.npmrc` is ignored by git and must never be committed. This file, with the
; placeholder, is the one that is committed.
;
; The token is the one issued with your challenge. It needs `read:packages`.
; Without it `npm install` fails with a 401, because
; @vinovalab/storage-connector-contract is published to GitHub Packages and not
; to the public registry.
;
; The same two lines work in ~/.npmrc if you would rather keep one copy for
; every repository.

@vinovalab:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=PASTE-YOUR-TOKEN-HERE
